Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Description: Docker images without a daemon
 RackBox pulls OCI/Docker images for this CPU (ARMv5 included), unpacks them
 into plain folders and runs every container as its own systemd service via
 systemd-nspawn – no daemon, no overlayfs. Includes an app catalog and the
 "Containers" page for RackPanel.
